### Variables ---------------------------------------------------------------
@api = http://localhost:3050/api/v1/institutos

### GET - lista completa del catalogo
GET {{api}}

### GET - un instituto por llave interna (IdInstitutoOK)
GET {{api}}/1

### GET - un instituto por llave interna, indicando el tipo de llave
GET {{api}}/1?keyType=OK

### GET - un instituto por clave externa (IdInstitutoBK)
GET {{api}}/18DIT0009Y?keyType=BK

### POST - alta de un instituto
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user: KPEREZ

{
  "IdInstitutoOK": "5",
  "IdInstitutoBK": "18DIT0005Y",
  "DesInstituto": "Instituto Tecnologico de Ruiz",
  "Alias": "ITR",
  "Matriz": "N",
  "Giro": "EDUCACION",
  "IdInstitutoSupOK": "1"
}

### POST - alta masiva enviando un arreglo JSON
POST {{api}}/manyInstitutos
Content-Type: application/json
x-user: KPEREZ

[
  {
    "IdInstitutoOK": "6",
    "IdInstitutoBK": "18DIT0006W",
    "DesInstituto": "Instituto Tecnologico de Compostela",
    "Alias": "ITC",
    "Matriz": "N",
    "Giro": "EDUCACION",
    "IdInstitutoSupOK": "1"
  }
]

### PUT - actualizar un instituto
PUT {{api}}/5
Content-Type: application/json
x-user: KPEREZ

{
  "DesInstituto": "Instituto Tecnologico de Ruiz - Campus Norte",
  "Alias": "ITR-N",
  "Matriz": "N"
}

### PUT - agregar o actualizar informacion adicional
PUT {{api}}/5/infoAdicional
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "IdEtiqueta": "IDRECTOR", "Etiqueta": "DIRECTOR", "Valor": "Dra. Ana Lopez", "Secuencia": 10 }
]

### DELETE - baja logica (detail_row.Borrado = 'S')
DELETE {{api}}/5
x-user: KPEREZ

### DELETE - baja fisica (elimina el documento)
DELETE {{api}}/6?modo=fisico

### Casos de error ----------------------------------------------------------

### 404 - instituto inexistente
GET {{api}}/999

### 409 - llave de negocio duplicada
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "IdInstitutoOK": "1",
  "IdInstitutoBK": "18DIT0002Z",
  "DesInstituto": "Duplicado"
}

### 400 - falta un campo obligatorio
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "IdInstitutoOK": "7" }
